          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Library"><strong>TerraPDF</strong></td>
            <td data-label="Best fit">Code-first document generation for .NET apps</td>
            <td data-label="Licensing model">MIT</td>
            <td data-label="Dependency footprint">Pure C#, zero runtime dependencies</td>
            <td data-label="TerraPDF advantage">Simple fluent API, tables, links, bookmarks, vector graphics, barcodes/QR codes, and AES-256 encryption in one package</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Library"><a href="https://www.questpdf.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">QuestPDF</a></td>
            <td data-label="Best fit">Polished report and document layouts</td>
            <td data-label="Licensing model">Community and commercial tiers</td>
            <td data-label="Dependency footprint">Includes native rendering assets</td>
            <td data-label="TerraPDF advantage">TerraPDF keeps the install smaller and the license story simpler for any project size</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Library"><a href="https://www.pdfsharp.com/PdfSharp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PDFsharp</a></td>
